  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "食飽無煩惱"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>趙善權</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">「今年貴庚？食飽--未？」朋友笑笑kā我問，我講，「哈哈，拄好65」。朋友又koh笑笑講，「Tse m̄就是 “法定老人”--ah！」</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">1958是我出世ê年koh，hit冬有一層大代誌。8月23阿共起兇狂，炮彈烏白飛，金門小島pìn-piàng叫，suà--落-來siàu想beh食台灣。好佳哉tsiú有tiâu，聽講美援兩支大炮來幫贊。除了當時外省ê阿兵哥，mā有濟濟台灣充員兵，犧牲in ê青春kap性命。就án-ne決定台灣ê運命，保持「一爿一國」到現在。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">人生起起又落落，總算平順年年過，生離死別免不了，阿爸阿母koh有兩位兄哥，到tsia來我是阮家族ê頭人。老爸1947年孤身福州過台灣，落地生根生湠囝孫tsiūnn 20，ǹg望代代生湠，安居樂業tsiânn做永遠ê台灣人。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">「法定老人」是啥意思？簡單講就是tī人生路途，不管佗一个行業65歲lóng ài退休--落-來。退休人生beh按怎過？人講第一要緊，身體ài顧好。醫生講ài tsia̍p運動（『要活就要動』），另外koh講mài食siunn好（「食khah bái」--leh）；我講心情放輕鬆，閒事mài siunn tshap，囝孫自有囝孫福，日常ke減做好代，食飽無煩惱。</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><span></span><span><a name='more'></a></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjdxMsnzPGmKohcbVv8nJwdesZha1SpizfzsDHTc3odbXh3buCI2j45oguhTBogtHwwkFEbCCnDNuidi2jS1Gz7iRCMlkffY-nVAne3AYTgmjk-PjLceWIwhMD-SrOcNnVUCKKrxJud6tl0Lt6upQubTCLDWhxSjD6sTZHMop7JUOfGgr99-ORj24EOxqA9/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1360%E6%9C%9F_020B.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjdxMsnzPGmKohcbVv8nJwdesZha1SpizfzsDHTc3odbXh3buCI2j45oguhTBogtHwwkFEbCCnDNuidi2jS1Gz7iRCMlkffY-nVAne3AYTgmjk-PjLceWIwhMD-SrOcNnVUCKKrxJud6tl0Lt6upQubTCLDWhxSjD6sTZHMop7JUOfGgr99-ORj24EOxqA9/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1360%E6%9C%9F_020B.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgdL_87KQuuGUp0XlsioK1Zs0lvmq-4T6LHGbLlp8899siE5V_dgPz2V-ReQkHQQhvfAqk5yOtOIScGN9IxBqNPOf1cABV1h4fDatDxKlFdmuprc2j8r9riqrOSn_7MJY2aNpPNwRG1gw-oJXOqUXnUc3YymJl94koz3qtXrqXZCQlgwpcZ1lFUzzHV4I6x/s1424/360%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgdL_87KQuuGUp0XlsioK1Zs0lvmq-4T6LHGbLlp8899siE5V_dgPz2V-ReQkHQQhvfAqk5yOtOIScGN9IxBqNPOf1cABV1h4fDatDxKlFdmuprc2j8r9riqrOSn_7MJY2aNpPNwRG1gw-oJXOqUXnUc3YymJl94koz3qtXrqXZCQlgwpcZ1lFUzzHV4I6x/w450-h640/360%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>#逐家來phò-tāu&nbsp;專欄，本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap台羅。</b><br /><br /></span></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"background-color: white; font-fa